# TEST-only tools for the sidecar's unit and HTTP-contract tests, installed
# into a throwaway environment -- never into the shipped image.
#
# fastapi and python-multipart are the HTTP layer's own runtime deps
# (starlette comes with fastapi). There is no runtime requirements.txt yet
# (it lands with the image in slice 4 of #1005), so
# they are pinned here, at the versions that runtime lock will carry. Once
# it exists, the image already has them, and they should leave this file so
# the two lists cannot drift to different versions of the same package
# (same rationale as deploy/yamnet-detector/requirements-test.in).
#
# httpx is not a direct import of test_app.py -- it is what
# starlette.testclient.TestClient requires, and the concurrency tests use
# httpx.ASGITransport directly.
pytest
httpx
fastapi==0.138.0
python-multipart==0.0.32
